  "guide.start.ascent.b": "You found a dynasty and then try to hold it. Invaders arrive on a clock, and each wave is larger than the last. Between waves the realm asks what to take, which power to keep and who to raise. The run ends when the capital falls — and everything it was worth is banked toward the next one.",
